hexdump
Usage: hexdump [-bcdoxCv] [-e FORMAT_STR] [-f FORMAT_FILE] [-n LENGTH] [-s OFFSET] [FILE]...

Display FILEs (or stdin) in a user specified format.

	-b		1-byte octal display
	-c		1-byte character display
	-d		2-byte decimal display
	-o		2-byte octal display
	-x		2-byte hex display
	-C		Hex with text beside it
	-v		Don't fold repeats into *
	-e FORMAT_STR	Use your own display format
	-f FORMAT_FILE	Read the format from FORMAT_FILE
	-n LENGTH	Show only first LENGTH bytes
	-s OFFSET	Skip OFFSET bytes
